<section image-layout="blank" id="RNiNDCAzSN"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="k1ar4jpiBP"><h2>Predict the UV path</h2><p font-size="18pt"><b>Same Sun. Same three incoming UV rays. Same Earth.</b> Only the amount of stratospheric ozone changes. Which ground receives less harmful UV?</p><freeform-block w="840" h="275"><box type="content" x="0" y="0" w="405" h="258" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="border-radius:18pt;"></box><box type="content" x="435" y="0" w="405" h="258" sizing="fixed" background-color="surface" style="border-radius:18pt;"></box><box type="content" x="24" y="12" w="220"><h3>More ozone</h3><p font-size="16pt">5 ozone dots in this model</p></box><box type="content" x="459" y="12" w="220"><h3>Less ozone</h3><p font-size="16pt">2 ozone dots in this model</p></box><shape preset="ellipse" x="35" y="70" w="50" h="50" fill="palette-2" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="ellipse" x="470" y="70" w="50" h="50" fill="palette-2" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="line" x="130" y="76" w="2" h="82" stroke="palette-2" stroke-width="4"></shape><shape preset="line" x="202" y="76" w="2" h="82" stroke="palette-2" stroke-width="4"></shape><shape preset="line" x="274" y="76" w="2" h="82" stroke="palette-2" stroke-width="4"></shape><shape preset="line" x="565" y="76" w="2" h="82" stroke="palette-2" stroke-width="4"></shape><shape preset="line" x="637" y="76" w="2" h="82" stroke="palette-2" stroke-width="4"></shape><shape preset="line" x="709" y="76" w="2" h="82" stroke="palette-2" stroke-width="4"></shape><box type="content" x="38" y="154" w="329" h="24" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="border-radius:999pt;"></box><box type="content" x="473" y="154" w="329" h="24" sizing="fixed" background-color="accent" style="border-radius:999pt;"></box><shape preset="ellipse" x="80" y="158" w="16" h="16" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="ellipse" x="122" y="158" w="16" h="16" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="ellipse" x="164" y="158" w="16" h="16" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="ellipse" x="266" y="158" w="16" h="16" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="ellipse" x="308" y="158" w="16" h="16" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="ellipse" x="557" y="158" w="16" h="16" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape><shape preset="ellipse" x="749" y="158" w="16" h="16" fill="surface" stroke-width="0"></shape><box type="content" x="88" y="194" w="225" h="72" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-5" style="border-radius:999pt;"><h3 align="center">?</h3><p font-size="16pt" align="center">harmful UV at the ground</p></box><box type="content" x="523" y="194" w="225" h="72" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="palette-5" style="border-radius:999pt;"><h3 align="center">?</h3><p font-size="16pt" align="center">harmful UV at the ground</p></box></freeform-block><p font-size="lg"><b>Point, vote and explain your reason.</b></p></grid-item></grid></section>